# Services are singletons with a flat property surface and, without exception,
# an `available` flag. They may never import ui/ — the dependency runs one way.
#
# Registered here because Quickshell loads through a virtual filesystem, where
# QML's implicit same-folder rule does not apply. See common/qmldir.
singleton Apps 1.0 Apps.qml
singleton Compositor 1.0 Compositor.qml
singleton Niri 1.0 Niri.qml
# Opens the same programs again after a restart. Records while you work, not at
# shutdown, and restores once per session rather than once per shell start.
singleton Restore 1.0 Restore.qml
singleton Power 1.0 Power.qml
singleton Idle 1.0 Idle.qml
singleton Audio 1.0 Audio.qml
singleton Net 1.0 Net.qml
singleton Bt 1.0 Bt.qml
singleton Media 1.0 Media.qml
singleton Notifications 1.0 Notifications.qml
singleton Brightness 1.0 Brightness.qml
singleton Nightlight 1.0 Nightlight.qml
singleton Themes 1.0 Themes.qml
singleton Wallpaper 1.0 Wallpaper.qml
singleton Ical 1.0 Ical.qml
singleton Calculator 1.0 Calculator.qml
singleton Countdown 1.0 Countdown.qml
singleton Calendar 1.0 Calendar.qml
singleton Weather 1.0 Weather.qml
singleton Location 1.0 Location.qml
singleton Tray 1.0 Tray.qml
singleton Clipboard 1.0 Clipboard.qml
singleton Theming 1.0 Theming.qml
singleton Installed 1.0 Installed.qml
# The answers this machine already knows, for the settings rows that used to be
# empty text boxes. Bindings over the services above — no process of its own.
singleton Suggest 1.0 Suggest.qml
singleton Gpu 1.0 Gpu.qml
# Which tree this desktop runs from, and whether the remote has more. Asks
# nothing until the System page is opened, and nothing again until a button.
singleton Update 1.0 Update.qml
